                "that delivers HF education (information and lifestyle advice per guidelines), which is                 
mHealth-delivered "                                                                                                     
                "education. The control group received standard information (usual care). Thus, all inclusion criteria "
                "(RCT, adults ≥18 with HF, mHealth education, usual care comparator) are satisfied."                    
            ),                                                                                                          
