reflecting greater self-care adherence. CONCLUSION Video education prompts self-care behavior adherence to control 
worsening signs/symptoms of volume overload. During 3-month follow-up, utilization of most healthcare resources was 
unchanged. PRACTICE IMPLICATIONS VE is a useful adjunct to in-person education.

