  study_title = "Mobile phone-based telemonitoring for heart failure management: a randomized controlled trial"         
  study_abstract = """BACKGROUND Previous trials of telemonitoring for heart failure management have reported           
  inconsistent results, largely due to diverse intervention and study designs. Mobile phones are becoming ubiquitous    
