is computer-based self-management programs delivered in healthcare settings, not mHealth-delivered education (e.g., 
apps, SMS, social media) targeting heart failure self-care. The comparison is not usual heart failure care. Therefore, 
the study does not meet any of the inclusion criteria and should be excluded with high confidence.

