  of self\u2010care which includes medications, monitoring of weight and symptoms, identification of signs of           
  deterioration and follow\u2010up and interaction with multiple healthcare services. Education is vital for            
  understanding the importance of this regimen, and adhering to it. Traditionally, education has been provided to       
