messages and social media-delivered education programmes, versus usual HF care."                                        
                                                                                                                        
# Study index                                                                                                           
study_index = 146                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                        
# Call the screen_study tool                                                                                            
screening_result = screen_study(study_title, study_abstract, selection_criteria, study_index)                           
print(screening_result)                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                        
