patients' or diabetes patients' quality of life or their clinical condition. There were indications that the            
intervention had a differential effect on heart patients and diabetes patients. Diabetes patients may be more prone to  
benefit from this kind of intervention. This should not be neglected when developing new ways for self-management of    
chronic diseases.                                                       Trial Registration                              
