Use of technology in training patients with implantable cardioverter defibrillator

STUDY ABSTRACT:
Implantable cardioverter defibrillator (ICD) devices provide a treatment method that is frequently used for the cure of 
terminal arrhythmias and advanced-stage heart failures. Even though the ICDs are clinically efficient, they bring along 
