program involving collaborative care, home telemonitoring, self-management support, and comorbid depression 
screening/treatment. It does not specifically test an mHealth-delivered education intervention such as 
internet/web-based education for smartphones/tablets, apps, SMS, or social media. The selection criteria require the 
intervention to be predominantly mHealth-delivered education, not a complex disease management model with telemonitoring
and other components. Thus, it fails the intervention criterion.

