Title: Just-in-time evidence-based e-mail "reminders" in home health care: impact on patient outcomes
Abstract: OBJECTIVE To assess the impact and cost-effectiveness of two information-based provider reminder interventions
designed to improve self-care management and outcomes of heart failure (HF) patients. DATA SOURCES/STUDY SETTING 
