system (MedSentry) focused on tracking and reminding medication adherence, not on providing health education. It does 
not fit the mHealth-delivered education criteria defined by the review (e.g., internet-based education programmes, SMS 
education, apps for learning). Thus, it fails the intervention criterion.", "confidence": "high"}]}
