program is available in both printed and Web-based formats. In a pilot study and clinical evaluation project, the 
program was found to be useful for patient education and feasible for implementation. Larger randomized trials are now 
warranted to evaluate the effectiveness of the intervention in improving compliance with the self-care regimen and 
thereby improving outcomes among patients with heart failure.Lippincott Williams & Wilkins

